                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2b5dcc7b-fcaf-3c9a-8229-4abe9fedf625",
                        "entry_id": "33359ce1-8901-3d42-b34e-dd1447a2acd0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "jumble"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a1391bd9-b174-4f0b-a254-a0498dbaceaa",
                                "sense_id": "2b5dcc7b-fcaf-3c9a-8229-4abe9fedf625",
                                "text": "Я был на ли́нии желе́зной доро́ги, кото́рая ещё то́лько стро́илась. Высо́кая, наполови́ну гото́вая на́сыпь, ку́чи песку́, гли́ны и ще́бня, бара́ки, я́мы, разбро́санные ко́е-где́ та́чки, пло́ские возвыше́ния над земля́нками, в кото́рых жи́ли рабо́чие, — весь э́тот ерала́ш, вы́крашенный потёмками в оди́н цвет, придава́л земле́ каку́ю-то стра́нную, ди́кую физионо́мию, напомина́вшую о времена́х ха́оса.",
                                "translation": "I was on a railway line which was still in process of construction. The high, half-finished embankment, the mounds of sand, clay, and rubble, the holes, the wheel-barrows standing here and there, the flat tops of the mud huts in which the workmen lived--all this muddle, coloured to one tint by the darkness, gave the earth a strange, wild aspect that suggested the times of chaos.",
                                "english": "I was on a railway line which was still in process of construction. The high, half-finished embankment, the mounds of sand, clay, and rubble, the holes, the wheel-barrows standing here and there, the flat tops of the mud huts in which the workmen lived--all this muddle, coloured to one tint by the darkness, gave the earth a strange, wild aspect that suggested the times of chaos."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ae031bbd-4b4c-30a9-8b40-ab0c23ceaef3",
                        "entry_id": "33359ce1-8901-3d42-b34e-dd1447a2acd0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "eralash"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1065fdd6-370d-4531-b10b-672a05035372",
                                "sense_id": "ae031bbd-4b4c-30a9-8b40-ab0c23ceaef3",
                                "text": "В мо́лодости он ни в каки́е и́гры не игра́л, а тут пристрасти́лся к лото́, а когда́ запрети́ли лото́, к ерала́шу.",
                                "translation": "In his youth he had played no games of any kind, but now he developed a passion for loto, and, when loto was prohibited, for whist.",
                                "english": "In his youth he had played no games of any kind, but now he developed a passion for loto, and, when loto was prohibited, for whist."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
